    "title": "Rockets are right to return to double-big lineups - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By James Piercey ,\n1 days ago The Rockets know their double big lineups work, and they’re right to go back to the well. Basketball is the most stylish sport. There’s no way to quantify this, but it feels too true to include qualifiers. There’s more room for creativity. It’s poetry in motion. Read full article",
